{"seconds": 248.9, "exit": 0, "final": "Perfect! The forced sequence wins cleanly:\n\n**1...fxe6** (wins the knight immediately)  \n**2.Rd8+ Rxd8** (forced check and recapture)  \n**3.Rxd8+ Rxd8** (final rook trade)\n\nAfter the rook trades, Black is up a whole knight\u2014Black has N + 6P vs White's B + 6P.\n\n**Coaching Note (\u226480 words):**\nCapture the undefended piece! The e6 knight is only defended by the d6 rook. By playing fxe6, you win the knight immediately. When White checks with Rd8+, you trade: Rxd8 Rxd8+ Rxd8. You end up a full piece ahead. Always look for pieces defended by just one other piece\u2014they're vulnerable to capture.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"fxe6\", \"line\": [\"fxe6\", \"Rd8+\", \"Rxd8\", \"Rxd8+\", \"Rxd8\"], \"motifs\": [\"hangingPiece\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "r1r3k1/4npp1/3RN2p/p3p3/1p2P3/2P2P1P/PKPR1BP1/8 b - - 0 22"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "r1r3k1/4npp1/3RN2p/p3p3/1p2P3/2P2P1P/PKPR1BP1/8 b - - 0 22"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r1r3k1/4npp1/3RN2p/p3p3/1p2P3/2P2P1P/PKPR1BP1/8 b - - 0 22", "move": "Nf5"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r1r3k1/4npp1/3RN2p/p3p3/1p2P3/2P2P1P/PKPR1BP1/8 b - - 0 22", "move": "Nd5"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r1r3k1/4npp1/3RN2p/p3p3/1p2P3/2P2P1P/PKPR1BP1/8 b - - 0 22", "move": "Nc6"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r1r3k1/4npp1/3RN2p/p3p3/1p2P3/2P2P1P/PKPR1BP1/8 b - - 0 22", "move": "Rd8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r1r3k1/4npp1/3RN2p/p3p3/1p2P3/2P2P1P/PKPR1BP1/8 b - - 0 22", "move": "Rc1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r1r3k1/4npp1/3RN2p/p3p3/1p2P3/2P2P1P/PKPR1BP1/8 b - - 0 22", "move": "Rc2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r1r3k1/4npp1/3RN2p/p3p3/1p2P3/2P2P1P/PKPR1BP1/8 b - - 0 22", "move": "Ra1"}}, {"to